{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02926","headline":"奉和九月九日应制 · 贺敱","name":"奉和九月九日应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商飙凝素龠，玄览贲黄图。\n晓霜惊断雁，晨吹结栖乌。\n寒花低岸菊，凉叶下庭梧。\n泽宫申旧典，相圃叶前模。\n玉砌分雕戟，金沟转镂衢。\n带星飞夏箭，映月上轩弧。\n庆展簪裾洽，恩融雨露濡。\n天文发丹篆，宝思掩玄珠。\n承欢徒拚舞，负弛窃忘躯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺敱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}